    "summary": "These 28 Astra Militarum units gain the **FRAME** keyword:\n\n- **LEMAN RUSS VANQUISHER**, **LEMAN RUSS PUNISHER**, **LEMAN RUSS EXTERMINATOR**, **LEMAN RUSS EXECUTIONER**, **LEMAN RUSS ERADICATOR**, **LEMAN RUSS DEMOLISHER**, **LEMAN RUSS COMMANDER** and **LEMAN RUSS BATTLE TANK**\n- **ROGAL DORN BATTLE TANK** and **ROGAL DORN COMMANDER**\n- **BANEBLADE**, **BANEHAMMER**, **BANESWORD**, **DOOMHAMMER**, **HELLHAMMER**, **SHADOWSWORD**, **STORMLORD** and **STORMSWORD**\n- **CHIMERA**, **TAUROX**, **TAUROX PRIME**, **HELLHOUND**, **HYDRA**, **BASILISK**, **DEATHSTRIKE**, **MANTICORE** and **WYVERN**\n- **AEGIS DEFENCE LINE**",
